   "actionTime": "14:31:33",
   "sourceSystem": {
    "code": 2,
    "name": "House floor actions"
   },
   "text": "At the conclusion of debate, the chair put the question on the motion to suspend the rules. Mr. Frelinghuysen objected to the vote on the grounds that a quorum was not present. Further proceedings on the motion were postponed. The point of no quorum was withdrawn.",
   "type": "Floor"
  },
  {
   "actionCode": "H8D000",
   "actionDate": "2008-05-06",
   "actionTime": "14:09:23",
   "sourceSystem": {
    "code": 2,
    "name": "House floor actions"
   },
   "text": "DEBATE - The House proceeded with forty minutes of debate on H.R. 4279.",
   "type": "Floor"
  },
  {
   "actionCode": "H30000",
   "actionDate": "2008-05-06",
   "actionTime": "14:09:22",
   "sourceSystem": {
    "code": 2,
    "name": "House floor actions"
   },
   "text": "Considered under suspension of the rules. (consideration: CR H3067-3078)",
   "type": "Floor"
  },
  {
   "actionCode": "H30300",
   "actionDate": "2008-05-06",
   "actionTime": "14:09:00",
   "sourceSystem": {
    "code": 2,
    "name": "House floor actions"
   },
   "text": "Mr. Conyers moved to suspend the rules and pass the bill, as amended.",
